To run the python version of claw:
python -m pip install PySide6
set IPC_DIR to the location of IPC
set PYTHONPATH $IPC_DIR/python:$IPC_DIR/lib
set CENTRALHOST to the mraptor central (port 1382)
python claw.py

To create a standalone executable:
  1. Install pyinstaller: `python -m pip install pyinstaller`
  2. May need to sudo apt install libpython3.9
  3. Run pyinstaller: `pyinstaller --onefile claw.py`
  4. The executable will be located in the `dist` folder.